<g id="m3458764685970424616" data-miro-id="3458764685970424616" transform="translate(8000,7680)" data-frame="18. ECS Services, Cache and Async Responses">
<rect data-type="frame" x="0" y="0" width="3200" height="2240" fill="#ffffff" data-title="18. ECS Services, Cache and Async Responses" />
<textArea id="m3458764685970424620" data-miro-id="3458764685970424620" x="64" y="64" width="3072" height="94" fill="#231266" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="67" text-align="left" font-weight="bold">18. ECS Services, Cache and Async Responses</textArea>
<textArea id="m3458764685970424621" data-miro-id="3458764685970424621" x="64" y="184" width="3072" height="47" fill="#231266" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" text-align="left">Independent UI, API and workers. Accepted means durably saved; payment and fulfillment completion have separate states.</textArea>
<rect id="m3458764685970424622" data-miro-id="3458764685970424622" x="64" y="416" width="608" height="432" data-content="Web ECS service&lt;br /&gt;Next.js UI / BFF&lt;br /&gt;Independent scaling&lt;br /&gt;No commerce DB access" fill="#9ce6ff" data-text-color="#231266" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" stroke="#757575" />
<rect id="m3458764685970424623" data-miro-id="3458764685970424623" x="832" y="416" width="608" height="432" data-content="API ECS service&lt;br /&gt;Kotlin / Spring Boot&lt;br /&gt;Auth / quote / orders&lt;br /&gt;Returns owned status URL" fill="#9ce6ff" data-text-color="#231266" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" stroke="#757575" />
<rect id="m3458764685970424624" data-miro-id="3458764685970424624" x="1600" y="416" width="608" height="432" data-content="RDS PostgreSQL&lt;br /&gt;Short ACID commit&lt;br /&gt;Order / stock / outbox&lt;br /&gt;No provider call in locks" fill="#ffe86d" data-text-color="#231266" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" stroke="#757575" />
<rect id="m3458764685970424625" data-miro-id="3458764685970424625" x="2368" y="416" width="608" height="432" data-content="Worker ECS services&lt;br /&gt;Payment / fulfillment&lt;br /&gt;Refund / notification&lt;br /&gt;Catalog-media / outbox" fill="#b8acfb" data-text-color="#231266" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" stroke="#757575" />
<textArea id="m3458764685970424626" data-miro-id="3458764685970424626" x="64" y="928" width="3072" height="47" fill="#231266" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" text-align="left" font-weight="bold">Customer flow: saved order -&gt; preparing payment -&gt; checkout ready -&gt; verification pending -&gt; confirmed -&gt; delivery updates.</textArea>
<rect id="m3458764685970424627" data-miro-id="3458764685970424627" x="64" y="1136" width="992" height="672" fill="#ffe86d" data-text-color="#231266" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" stroke="#757575" />
<textArea id="m3458764685970424628" data-miro-id="3458764685970424628" x="96" y="1184" width="928" height="47" fill="#231266" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" text-align="left" font-weight="bold">Cache boundaries</textArea>
<textArea id="m3458764685970424629" data-miro-id="3458764685970424629" x="96" y="1296" width="928" height="185" fill="#231266" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" text-align="left">CloudFront: UI assets and public media. Valkey: versioned public catalog. Private pages, carts, quotes, ownership, payment/refund truth and stock decisions bypass shared caches.</textArea>
<rect id="m3458764685970424630" data-miro-id="3458764685970424630" x="1104" y="1136" width="992" height="672" fill="#b8acfb" data-text-color="#231266" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" stroke="#757575" />
<textArea id="m3458764685970424631" data-miro-id="3458764685970424631" x="1136" y="1184" width="928" height="47" fill="#231266" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" text-align="left" font-weight="bold">Prompt async response</textArea>
<textArea id="m3458764685970424632" data-miro-id="3458764685970424632" x="1136" y="1296" width="928" height="231" fill="#231266" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" text-align="left">Return 202 only after durable order / reservation / attempt / outbox commit. A worker prepares payment; UI polls owned status. Verified payment triggers fulfillment without waiting for delivery jobs.</textArea>
<rect id="m3458764685970424633" data-miro-id="3458764685970424633" x="2144" y="1136" width="992" height="672" fill="#9ce6ff" data-text-color="#231266" data-font-family="noto_sans" data-font-size="33" stroke="#757575" />
<textArea id="m3458764685970424634" data-miro-id="3458764685970424634" x="2176" y="1184" width="928" height="47" fill="#231266" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" text-align="left" font-weight="bold">Independent operations</textArea>
<textArea id="m3458764685970424635" data-miro-id="3458764685970424635" x="2176" y="1296" width="928" height="185" fill="#231266" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" text-align="left">Per-service roles, secrets, deployments and scaling. Bound total DB connections and provider concurrency. Isolate queue failures; reconcile unknown outcomes. Migration is a controlled one-off task.</textArea>
<textArea id="m3458764685970424636" data-miro-id="3458764685970424636" x="64" y="1952" width="3072" height="47" fill="#231266" font-family="noto_sans" font-size="33" text-align="left">Security/test gates: prepared SQL, current ownership checks, Secrets Manager credentials, unit + PostgreSQL integration + WireMock + AWS staging tests.</textArea>
</g>
